<doxygen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="compound.xsd" version="1.18.0" xml:lang="en-US">
  <compounddef id="hetero_8md" kind="file" language="Markdown">
    <compoundname>hetero.md</compoundname>
    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
    </detaileddescription>
    <programlisting>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Networks<sp/>With<sp/>Heterogeneous<sp/>Agents<sp/>{#hetero}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\note<sp/>This<sp/>page<sp/>assumes<sp/>familiarity<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>basic<sp/>layout<sp/>and<sp/>API<sp/>usage<sp/>described<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>main<sp/>@ref<sp/>examples<sp/>page.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">As<sp/>explained<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>@ref<sp/>hetero-dynamics<sp/>section,<sp/>agents<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>network<sp/>do<sp/>not<sp/>necessarily<sp/>need<sp/>to<sp/>share<sp/>dynamics,<sp/>noise,<sp/>or<sp/>discrete<sp/>callback<sp/>functions.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Whenever<sp/>any<sp/>of<sp/>these<sp/>are<sp/>distinct<sp/>for<sp/>any<sp/>two<sp/>agents,<sp/>the<sp/>network<sp/>is<sp/>said<sp/>to<sp/>exhibit<sp/>heterogeneous<sp/>dynamics.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Let<sp/>us<sp/>modify<sp/>the<sp/>basic<sp/>example<sp/>shown<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>@ref<sp/>multi<sp/>section<sp/>to<sp/>have<sp/>the<sp/>three<sp/>vertices<sp/>instead<sp/>evolve<sp/>according<sp/>to</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\frac{dx_1}{dt}<sp/>=<sp/>Ax_1t,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\frac{d\vec{x}_2}{dt}<sp/>=<sp/>B\sin{x_2^{[1]}}<sp/>-<sp/>Dx_2^{[2]}\cos{t},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\frac{dx_3}{dt}<sp/>=<sp/>\begin{cases}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0<sp/>&amp;<sp/>\text{if}~t<sp/>&lt;<sp/>1<sp/>\\</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>t<sp/>&amp;<sp/>\text{otherwise}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\end{cases}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">To<sp/>further<sp/>emphasise<sp/>heterogeneity,<sp/>the<sp/>second<sp/>vertex<sp/>has<sp/>a<sp/>two-element<sp/>state<sp/>vector,<sp/>and<sp/>the<sp/>third<sp/>evolves<sp/>according<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>piecewise<sp/>function.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">As<sp/>before,<sp/>we<sp/>simply<sp/>define<sp/>the<sp/>different<sp/>equations<sp/>in<sp/>separate<sp/>dynamics<sp/>functions.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>dyn1(NDXLVertex*<sp/>v1,<sp/>double*<sp/>dx1,<sp/>const<sp/>double*<sp/>x1,<sp/>double<sp/>t,<sp/>void*<sp/>p)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>A<sp/>=<sp/>*(double*)p;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx1[0]<sp/>=<sp/>A<sp/>*<sp/>x1[0]<sp/>*<sp/>t;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>dyn2(NDXLVertex*<sp/>v2,<sp/>double*<sp/>dx2,<sp/>const<sp/>double*<sp/>x2,<sp/>double<sp/>t,<sp/>void*<sp/>p)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>B<sp/>=<sp/>((double*)p)[0];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>D<sp/>=<sp/>((double*)p)[1];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx2[0]<sp/>=<sp/>B<sp/>*<sp/>sin(x2[0]);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx2[1]<sp/>=<sp/>-D<sp/>*<sp/>x2[1]<sp/>*<sp/>cos(t);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>dyn3(NDXLVertex*<sp/>v3,<sp/>double*<sp/>dx3,<sp/>const<sp/>double*<sp/>x3,<sp/>double<sp/>t,<sp/>void*<sp/>p)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Piecewise<sp/>function</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>(t<sp/>&gt;=<sp/>1.0)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx3[0]<sp/>=<sp/>t;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>else</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx3[0]<sp/>=<sp/>0.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>network<sp/>callback<sp/>for<sp/>writing<sp/>output<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>file<sp/>has<sp/>identical<sp/>structure<sp/>to<sp/>what<sp/>has<sp/>been<sp/>shown<sp/>in<sp/>previous<sp/>examples,<sp/>so<sp/>we<sp/>will<sp/>not<sp/>repeat<sp/>it<sp/>here.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">In<sp/>`main()`,<sp/>the<sp/>vertices<sp/>can<sp/>either<sp/>be<sp/>assigned<sp/>the<sp/>dynamics<sp/>functions<sp/>as<sp/>we<sp/>have<sp/>been<sp/>doing<sp/>up<sp/>to<sp/>now...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlInit();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Create<sp/>extra<sp/>parameters<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>single<sp/>array<sp/>which<sp/>we<sp/>will<sp/>offset<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>ABD[3]<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>1.6,<sp/>2.3,<sp/>0.7<sp/>};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Create<sp/>initial<sp/>conditions<sp/>for<sp/>vertex<sp/>1</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>x1_0<sp/>=<sp/>1.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Create<sp/>initial<sp/>conditions<sp/>for<sp/>vertex<sp/>2</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>x2_0[2]<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>0.5,<sp/>0.6<sp/>};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Vertex<sp/>3<sp/>shall<sp/>have<sp/>the<sp/>initial<sp/>condition<sp/>x3_0<sp/>=<sp/>0,<sp/>so<sp/>we<sp/>can<sp/>simply<sp/>pass<sp/>NULL<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>state<sp/>vector</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Technically,<sp/>we<sp/>must<sp/>then<sp/>also<sp/>pass<sp/>a<sp/>&quot;state<sp/>vector<sp/>size&quot;<sp/>of<sp/>1<sp/>to<sp/>create<sp/>a<sp/>scalar</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>However,<sp/>NDXL<sp/>enforces<sp/>a<sp/>minimum<sp/>size<sp/>of<sp/>1,<sp/>so<sp/>even<sp/>passing<sp/>0<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>length<sp/>would<sp/>give<sp/>the<sp/>desired<sp/>result</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Sine<sp/>ABD<sp/>is<sp/>already<sp/>a<sp/>double*,<sp/>we<sp/>can<sp/>use<sp/>pointer<sp/>arithmetic<sp/>to<sp/>get<sp/>the<sp/>position<sp/>in<sp/>ABD<sp/>where<sp/>the<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`<sp/>of<sp/>vertices<sp/>1<sp/>and<sp/>2<sp/>are</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(nwk,<sp/>&amp;x1_0,<sp/>1,<sp/>dyn1,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>ABD);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(nwk,<sp/>x2_0,<sp/>2,<sp/>dyn2,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>ABD<sp/>+<sp/>1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(nwk,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>1,<sp/>dyn3,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">...or<sp/>we<sp/>can<sp/>set<sp/>the<sp/>dynamics<sp/>after<sp/>creation<sp/>using<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlSetVertexDynamics.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>could<sp/>take<sp/>this<sp/>a<sp/>step<sp/>further,<sp/>and<sp/>delay<sp/>initial<sp/>state<sp/>and<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`<sp/>assignment<sp/>until<sp/>after<sp/>creation<sp/>as<sp/>well,<sp/>using<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlVertexState<sp/>and<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlSetVertexParams<sp/>to<sp/>update<sp/>them,<sp/>respectively.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>only<sp/>caveat<sp/>is<sp/>to<sp/>ensure<sp/>we<sp/>pass<sp/>2<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>size<sp/>of<sp/>vertex<sp/>2&apos;s<sp/>state<sp/>vector,<sp/>as<sp/>the<sp/>size<sp/>cannot<sp/>be<sp/>changed<sp/>later.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlInit();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Create<sp/>three<sp/>empty,<sp/>stateless,<sp/>static<sp/>vertices</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>For<sp/>vertices<sp/>1<sp/>and<sp/>3,<sp/>a<sp/>state<sp/>size<sp/>of<sp/>0<sp/>or<sp/>1<sp/>both<sp/>result<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>zero-vector<sp/>of<sp/>length<sp/>1</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>For<sp/>vertex<sp/>2,<sp/>we<sp/>MUST<sp/>specify<sp/>the<sp/>size<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>2</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NDXLVertex*<sp/>v1<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(nwk,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NDXLVertex*<sp/>v2<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(nwk,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>2,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NDXLVertex*<sp/>v3<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(nwk,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>1,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Create<sp/>extra<sp/>parameters<sp/>and<sp/>assign<sp/>them<sp/>using<sp/>the<sp/>parameters<sp/>setter</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>ABD[3]<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>1.6,<sp/>2.3,<sp/>0.7<sp/>};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlSetVertexParams(v1,<sp/>ABD);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlSetVertexParams(v2,<sp/>ABD<sp/>+<sp/>1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Assign<sp/>initial<sp/>conditions<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>vertices<sp/>-<sp/>since<sp/>v3<sp/>has<sp/>x3_0<sp/>=<sp/>0,<sp/>we<sp/>don&apos;t<sp/>have<sp/>to<sp/>update<sp/>it<sp/>at<sp/>all!</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlVertexState(v1)[0]<sp/>=<sp/>1.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlVertexState(v2)[0]<sp/>=<sp/>0.5;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlVertexState(v2)[1]<sp/>=<sp/>0.5;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Assign<sp/>the<sp/>dynamics<sp/>functions</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlSetVertexDynamics(v1,<sp/>dyn1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlSetVertexDynamics(v2,<sp/>dyn2);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlSetVertexDynamics(v3,<sp/>dyn3);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>simulate<sp/>the<sp/>network<sp/>again<sp/>using<sp/>the<sp/>Cash-Karp<sp/>integrator,<sp/>with<sp/>a<sp/>time<sp/>stop<sp/>at<sp/>\f$t=1\f$<sp/>to<sp/>ensure<sp/>the<sp/>piecewise<sp/>dynamics<sp/>of<sp/>`v3`<sp/>transition<sp/>at<sp/>the<sp/>appropriate<sp/>time.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlInit();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>tstop<sp/>=<sp/>1.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlNetworkSimulateRkck(nwk,<sp/>5.0,<sp/>1e-6,<sp/>1e-3,<sp/>&amp;tstop,<sp/>1,<sp/>cb);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">![](@ref<sp/>hetero.png)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Single-Agent<sp/>Heterogeneity</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>above<sp/>example<sp/>is<sp/>one<sp/>way<sp/>to<sp/>simulate<sp/>heterogeneous<sp/>dynamics,<sp/>but<sp/>not<sp/>the<sp/>only<sp/>way.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">One<sp/>could<sp/>just<sp/>as<sp/>easily<sp/>combine<sp/>the<sp/>state<sp/>vectors<sp/>of<sp/>all<sp/>the<sp/>vertices<sp/>into<sp/>a<sp/>single,<sp/>contiguous<sp/>vector,<sp/>and<sp/>define<sp/>the<sp/>heterogeneous<sp/>dynamics<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>dynamics<sp/>function.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>code<sp/>is<sp/>identical<sp/>to<sp/>@ref<sp/>highorder,<sp/>and<sp/>indeed<sp/>one<sp/>could<sp/>consider<sp/>a<sp/>coupled<sp/>system<sp/>of<sp/>ODEs<sp/>as<sp/>having<sp/>distinct<sp/>dynamics<sp/>equations,<sp/>because<sp/>the<sp/>right-hand<sp/>side<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>equation<sp/>differs<sp/>for<sp/>each<sp/>variable.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">As<sp/>an<sp/>example,<sp/>consider<sp/>a<sp/>Lotka-Volterra<sp/>type<sp/>interaction<sp/>between<sp/>a<sp/>predator<sp/>\f$N_{pred}\f$<sp/>and<sp/>prey<sp/>\f$N_{prey}\f$<sp/>population,<sp/>given<sp/>by</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\frac{{\rm<sp/>d}N_{prey}}{{\rm<sp/>d}t}<sp/>=<sp/>\alpha<sp/>N_{prey}<sp/>-<sp/>\beta<sp/>N_{prey}N_{pred},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\frac{{\rm<sp/>d}N_{pred}}{{\rm<sp/>d}t}<sp/>=<sp/>\delta<sp/>N_{prey}N_{pred}<sp/>-<sp/>\gamma<sp/>N_{pred}.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Instead<sp/>of<sp/>defining<sp/>separate<sp/>vertices<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>populations,<sp/>we<sp/>shall<sp/>use<sp/>a<sp/>single<sp/>vertex<sp/>whose<sp/>state<sp/>vector<sp/>contains<sp/>both<sp/>populations.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">In<sp/>our<sp/>dynamics<sp/>function,<sp/>we<sp/>then<sp/>simply<sp/>write<sp/>either<sp/>equation<sp/>to<sp/>its<sp/>corresponding<sp/>index<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>output<sp/>vector.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>lv(NDXLVertex*<sp/>pops,<sp/>double*<sp/>dN,<sp/>const<sp/>double*<sp/>N,<sp/>double<sp/>t,<sp/>void*<sp/>p)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>alpha<sp/>=<sp/>((double*)p)[0];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>beta<sp/>=<sp/>((double*)p)[1];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>delta<sp/>=<sp/>((double*)p)[2];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>gamma<sp/>=<sp/>((double*)p)[3];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Prey<sp/>equation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dN[0]<sp/>=<sp/>alpha<sp/>*<sp/>N[0]<sp/>-<sp/>beta<sp/>*<sp/>N[0]<sp/>*<sp/>N[1];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Predator<sp/>equation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dN[1]<sp/>=<sp/>delta<sp/>*<sp/>N[0]<sp/>*<sp/>N[1]<sp/>-<sp/>gamma<sp/>*<sp/>N[1];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Then<sp/>in<sp/>`main()`<sp/>we<sp/>set<sp/>up<sp/>the<sp/>network<sp/>as<sp/>usual,<sp/>this<sp/>time<sp/>having<sp/>only<sp/>one<sp/>vertex.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Output<sp/>capturing<sp/>remains<sp/>semantically<sp/>unchanged,<sp/>though<sp/>we<sp/>will<sp/>use<sp/>a<sp/>static<sp/>stepping<sp/>simulation<sp/>method<sp/>here<sp/>instead<sp/>to<sp/>illustrate<sp/>the<sp/>parameter<sp/>differences.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlInit();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>N0[2]<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>40.0,<sp/>9.0<sp/>};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>ABDG[4]<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>1.0,<sp/>0.1,<sp/>0.075,<sp/>1.5<sp/>};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(nwk,<sp/>N0,<sp/>2,<sp/>lv,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>ABDG);</highlight></codeline>
